# Crease

Crease is a mobile-first Progressive Web App for amateur and semi-professional cricket teams.

Primary Roles

- Admin
- Captain
- Vice Captain
- Player

Core Modules

- Authentication (Mobile OTP)
- Teams
- Polls
- Availability
- Transport
- Tournaments
- Match Fees
- Team Kitty
- Expenses
- Payments
- Notifications
- Reports

Guiding principles

- Mobile first
- PWA first
- Responsive desktop
- Clean architecture
- Reusable components
- No duplicated business logic
